0.025 CE 55.836\n('subtraction', 0, 256) T_M [500, 500, 500] train 100.0 held 0.0 sd 0.0 CE 91.147\n('subtraction', 1, 16) T_M [None, None, None] train 55.625 held 0.178 sd 0.039 CE 8.144\n('subtraction', 1, 64) T_M [500, 500, 500] train 100.0 held 0.053 sd 0.027 CE 13.284\n('subtraction', 1, 256) T_M [500, 500, 500] train 100.0 held 0.117 sd 0.058 CE 8.293\nBoth supplementary numeric tables exactly match derived table artifacts.\nInitial norm mean 16 6.288\nInitial norm mean 64 7.383\nInitial norm mean 256 10.904\nControl averages {'constant': 0.8652094518765807, 'copy': 0.8652094518765807, 'deranged': 0.9492005394875176, 'initial': 1.0507319432993731}\nData splits {'addition': {'train': 1411, 'heldout': 3294}, 'subtraction': {'train': 1411, 'heldout': 3294}}\nDurations [786.3929076768691, 777.5457442849874, 786.8748253490776]\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
